  v_program["On the CameraManager <br/>thread, the <br/>queueRequestDevice <br/>implementer programs the <br/>device to apply request <br/>parameters to frames <br/>captured in the supplied <br/>buffers."]
  v_queue_result["Return 0 on success or a <br/>negative error on failure."]
  v_buffer["The handler calls <br/>completeBuffer on the <br/>CameraManager thread to <br/>notify the application and <br/>update tracking."]
  v_last["The request does not <br/>automatically complete when <br/>the last buffer completes."]
  v_request["The handler explicitly <br/>calls completeRequest after <br/>any remaining work."]
  v_program -->|"Queue result"| v_queue_result
  v_program -->|"When a captured buffer <br/>completes"| v_buffer
  v_buffer -->|"When it is the last buffer"| v_last
  v_last -->|"Explicit request completion"| v_request
